 AI features
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Settings › AI › Your own server: an API address (the whole endpoint works
too) and an optional key, checked with the server's model list, stored
encrypted; its chat models in the picker. http:// only on this computer or
the local network. The consent sheet names the server's host; a server on
this computer or the local network needs no question.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
